+  //
+  // ViewPager2 intercepts at its paging slop (16dp) and a horizontal ScrollView
+  // claims at 8dp, but a parent sees every MOVE before its children and Android
+  // batches MOVEs once per frame: on a quick flick the first MOVE is already past
+  // 16dp, the pager takes it, and the shelf never gets to claim. So decide at
+  // ACTION_DOWN instead: switch the pager's user input off for that gesture only.
+  // In dispatchTouchEvent because once the shelf disallows interception, this
